                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Just a flash-quality puzzle game with 10 looped animal videos. The pieces click on right placement & are always properly oriented, so you can assemble pics without [strike]even looking at[/strike] much effort. The video plays in all the tiles simulteneously, giving you enough clues to guess the right place. I think it's an allright game for kids, still the UI quality leaves much to be desired, it feels rather cheap & unpolished.",
